# Bot RUNTIME state — machine-specific, never version this.
# options_state.json holds the LIVE open position; committing it would let one
# machine's stale position overwrite another's, so the bot would try to manage a
# trade that does not exist. dashboard_baseline.json is your own capital marker.
data/options_state.json
data/dashboard_baseline.json
data/locks/
signals.jsonl
points_signals.jsonl

